4 Conclusion
We present a software framework for augmented reality operation, localization, and data navigation in large scale industrial environments with mobile computers. Our framework can be used to i) Provide reliable localization results including both the position and the orientation in large scale industrial environments. ii) Augment the real-time view of the working environment with 3D object or additional information. iii) Provide ﬂexible ways for data interaction using a popup web browser that automatically connects the user to corresponding spatial data resources. iv) Provide a network interface for other users connected to the network to plug in their own applications that obtain the localization result and make use of it.
